{
  "id": "EZK.44",
  "number": "44",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Esekieli 44",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeedeaba dooshta duukusa heeda ghayeawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeelnean nea geasku dooshta mida jarooda heeda ghaydit, duukusa heeda ghayeawa, ak abeeda ea sijap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Dooshi gajeajap, ak ea majeajaat. Nea manda siida wassean jea gwasku dooshi, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA bea Israeli gwasku dooshi ak abeeda gajeajap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida haw niny dea jea goopteada aba gah gil ak ghwaak hamita aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gayghwahidu gah nea gwasku naweeda doodooda sigu dooshta, ak gaygwarita nea gwasik naweedida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedeeda gichea eabeada jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean nea goosiiknean dooshta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, bea madeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA. Ama aang'weardi ghaadaayi giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA nea ghwanyiit jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA bea NG'UTAMIIDA, hean ghaabeadi ak ghaabwadi jih ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ea orjeeda siida, iina jeeda gurooroadaang'u, ak ging'ulayi aba gheanyangaagu, ak giyiinyi aba iidigaagu, ng'asheega sean jea darukuneey, nea iita hamurajeega sean gil bea gheeda sibata ASEETA bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ea deaweedajeega sean, ak giyiini jeeda gurooroadaang'u gea jea gaweay jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, ea gea maygaweay heeda ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina fuga heawa was fuga Israeli, gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ea fuga Israeli aba badayda ng'asheegeagwa munyas sean biissa nideay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noong'udi ririnnyeanda heeda eabiiti, aba gideaba goonung' gaweay jeeda fuga miyeeyiil, fuga mamwasa ng'asheegeasu, nea nagheeda ea foojeanda geaghadoawanaan. Asi agooga fugeasu noadataschi neajeedeanyu aba ng'asheegeagwa munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mii afura haleanjeedeanyu ghaydidi, ak ea noogakiisi geat rabasta gafur heedeanyu ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, manda siida wassean bea eemoojiga, was rabasta miyeeyiil ghana dea mamwasa ng'asheegeasu jea gawa jeedeaba gheenyu eara rabasta mida jeeda fuga Israeli mwajeamwas gaweay jeedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Lawi geegeandeawa ashoohoocheanduumeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga Lawi nung'wanaan heeda, damanda rooda fuga Israeli, gwarooda ak ghwaat geeshta sanaamajeega nyaawa, ak gayghwasar ng'asheega nyaawa munyas nea gabwageat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyeessa gaygagadiiy aba heedeanyu ghaydit, nea gafur dooshta gheeda sibata ASEETA. Nea geegadiiyi aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, ak gaygwanuukiisa buuneeda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, ea lukghumajeega buuneeda, ak gayghamiinaada aba madeeda buuneeda eegadiyeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gagadiiyeesa saawa aba madeeda sanaamajeega nyaawa, ak ghoah rusooda ng'asheega munyas aba heeda fuga Israeli. Asi neagatgachi geatindeanyu dalas saawa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ak saawa gayghwasar giidiinyeanyeeka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa ea maygwaneekiisean gagadiyeesean aba gadiyeeda ashoohoocheanduumeeda, nea maygwaneekiisa haleanjeedeanyu ghaydidi eara akaleala, was haleanjeeda ghaydidi muuchi. Ak gayghwasar baspaseega nyaawa ea ng'asheega nyaawa munyas ghayi sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda saawa gaydanung' ghoah furiischoodiga, furiischoodiga gheeda sibata ASEETA. Ak gaygwasin gadiyoojiga sean ea gadiyoojiga sean jea eesin aba jeedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ashoohoodiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ashoohoodiga dooshta Lawi was orjooga Sadoki ghayi fur heedeanyu ghaydit, aba damanda ghayi roota fuga Israeli ak ghwanung'wanaan heeda, asi suh gea jea gwaneekiisean gil ak gagadiyeesean. Ak saawa gayghamiinaada aba madeedeanyu ak ghaghadoawan aniini aba nagheeda ea foojeanda, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygaweay heeda eabiiti ghaydit, ak gaygwaneekiisa meeseedeanyu gagadiyeesean ak gayghoah furiischoodigeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyeessa iisigu gidaghuuta doodoodeaba gah abeeda gajeekwealsa hang'weaka bumbuni miyaas, nea majeekwa hang'weaka sinabwa buudeega gisilga damanda gadiyeewa aba gidaghuuta doodooda mida gah ea aba gah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iheenga nyaawa gaygwanda shiipka miyaasiin bumbuni ea suruwaalajeega bumbuni aba mananuunatka nyaawa maygwarassa geat gida wassean jea gweadu gheawoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama saawa inyeessa gwarita gaweay doodooda mida jarooda, was doodooda jarooda bea buuneeda, abeeda gayghafwakta hang'weaka nyaawa ghayi akwa aba gadiyeeda nyaawa. Ak ghwayiin jeeda ghoorajeega ghaydidi, ak gajeeshuup hang'weaka suuk aba gideaba adaghang'ut ririnnyeanda buuneeda iisat hang'weaka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mayghwareakghu iheenga nyaawa, nea mayghwanung'waada buudeega nyaawa gageawiidi muuchi gayghwasuuy buudeega iheenga nyaawa gabeachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gilinyoo ea ashoohoocheanda gil, mayghwali difaayi, inyeessa gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashoohoocheanda wassean adaghaghi gatmooda was masinung'weanda, ghana gatmooda sinung'. Gayghaghi huda miyeegeanu bea fuga Israeli, ghana gatmooda nimi siyeadaanyi was ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gayghwanal fugeasu giiheeleeda haleanjeeda ghaydidi ea haleanjeedeaba gealaan, nea ghwanal gooheeli gea munyas ea gea miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iiridu jaliida abeeda gaygooheeli buuneeda ak gaygwalachiida girgweageeda gida ealachiidi aniini. Ak gayghoang'waay hamurajeegeasu ea deaweedajeegeasu ea ghweelmoojigeasu sean ghayi sirugu, ak gajeamiidu sabaatohajeegeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea maygwaneekiisa musta, aba gideaba adaghang'uda geaw ririnnyeanda, ak geaghus aba ghweanda ghana gheamata, ghana orjeeda ghana huda, ghana orjeeda geamadu, ghana huda miyeaghi; gayghang'uda geaw ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iimida dea ning'uda geaw ririnnyeanda abeeda gaygoobideatunu ea ghang'ata eawooji ispwa, abeeda gajea nimiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweeda jea gaweewa jeeda gheeda heeda ghaydit, bea doodooda, ak gagadiiy aba heeda ghaydit, abeeda gayghoadayda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda, ng'asheanji gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
