          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea saawa ea mayghwanyas hearaniischooda, aniini geawooschi hearaniischooda nyaawa, ak ea majoatawa hearaniischooda wassean aba Israeli, aniini geawooschi hearaniischooda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwaak booga sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda, ea haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea giidiinyeanda, ea haleanjeeda sean siikghaydiit aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli gayghoah daanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haghweega madeeda sean bea haleanjeeda sean aba giliwas haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda gayghoah gea ashoohoodiga. Ak gajoatawa ashoohoodiga dearanga madeeda aba gideaba ghoadaw gheang'u ghawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashoohoodiga mayghwaak banyeega diyeayda ghana dariideanda wassean meah nea gabwa geaw ghana dea bwar diyeayda jarooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.31"
            ]
          }
        }
